00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:20.530
And we are seeing

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:23.610
build exciting racing in the Firecracker 400.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:25.720
- Well, of course, they like not only the action,

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:27.720
they like Richard Petty leading.

