00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:36.030
They love Richard Petty. There's no question about it.

00:15:36.030 --> 00:15:40.030
Richard Petty, who has won in his career 199 Grand National

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:45.030
Races, far more than any other racer, and going for number

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:48.030
200 here today. Love to get it on this race course.

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:52.030
Petty, at this moment, leading the race ahead of Cale Yarbrough,

00:15:52.030 --> 00:15:55.030
and earlier Sam Posey spoke to him about this event.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:58.160
