00:15:58.160 --> 00:16:00.000
of what looks like on a male circle.

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:07.080
activity when you're in the hot cockpit and so forth but what is it like for you well i'm i feel

00:16:07.080 --> 00:16:11.280
