but again i think the the peace of mind i guess is what it is that you feel like that you've got

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:26.970
something there and you want to express yourself and that's the way i express myself instead of

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.600
being a painter or golfer or

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:35.850
Somebody that, you know, that creative deal, I create my own deal through driving a race car.

