00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:51.750
Not really.

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.760
I mean, you know, nobody's close to 199, right?

00:16:55.380 --> 00:17:00.000
So if I look at it this way, if somebody else had done 199,

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:03.720
